s (matching the coordinate notation used in the examples above). Internally you may use whatever data structure suits you (Set, Map, …), but the function boundary must match the signature above.\\n\\n## Expected Output Files\\n\\n- `src/game-of-life.ts` - Implementation\\n- `src/game-of-life.spec.ts` - Tests\\n\\n## Constraints\\n\\n- Use TypeScript\\n- Use sparse representation (only store living cells)\\n- Handle negative coordinates\\n\\n---\\ntotal 320\\ndrwxr-xr-x    5 experimenter experimenter   4096 Jul 25 06:37 .\\ndrwxrwxr-x 1032 experimenter experimenter 159744 Jul 25 06:37 ..\\ndrwxr-xr-x    5 experimenter experimenter   4096 Jul 25 06:37 .pi\\n-rw-r--r--    1 experimenter experimenter  11746 Jul 25 06:37 AGENTS.md\\n-rw-r--r--    1 experimenter experimenter   1568 Jul 25 06:37 eslint.config.mjs\\n-rw-r--r--    1 experimenter experimenter    373 Jul 25 06:37 metrics.json\\ndrwxr-xr-x    3 experimenter experimenter   4096 Jul 25 06:37 node_modules\\n-rw-r--r--    1 experimenter experimenter    537 Jul 25 06:37 package.json\\n-rw-r--r--    1 experimenter experimenter  79090 Jul 25 06:37 pnpm-lock.yaml\\n-rw-r--r--    1 experimenter experimenter   3073 Jul 25 06:37 prompt.md\\n-rw-r--r--    1 experimenter experimenter  27128 Jul 25 06:37 run.log\\ndrwxr-xr-x    2 experimenter experimenter   4096 Jul 25 06:37 src\\n-rw-r--r--    1 experimenter experimenter    236 Jul 25 06:37 tsconfig.json\\n-rw-r--r--    1 experimenter experimenter    306 Jul 25 06:37 vitest.config.ts\\n---\\n./prompt.md\\n./tsconfig.json\\n./metrics.json\\n./AGENTS.md\\n./vitest.config.ts\\n./package.json\\n./run.log\\n./pnpm-lock.yaml\\n./eslint.config.mjs\\n./.pi/extensions/subagent/README.md\\n./.pi/extensions/subagent/index.ts\\n./.pi/extensions/subagent/agents.ts\\n./.pi/AGENTS.md\\n./.pi/agents/refactor.md\\n./.pi/skills/red/SKILL.md\\n./.pi/skills/green/SKILL.md\\n./.pi/skills/test-list/SKILL.md\\n\"}],\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1784961435499}]}\n{\"type\":\"turn_start\"}","trun